title: ArchivioMD
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
version: 1.19.2
date-released: 2026-03-28
license: GPL-2.0-or-later

authors:
  - name: "Mountain View Provisions LLC"
    alias: mtnviewpro
    contact: Sean Bailey

repository-code: https://github.com/MountainViewProvisions/archiviomd
url: https://wordpress.org/plugins/archiviomd

abstract: >
  ArchivioMD adds a cryptographic proof layer to WordPress. Every post,
  page, and document receives a verifiable integrity record independently
  checkable without trusting the platform, host, or database. Features
  include content hashing with 20+ algorithms, HMAC integrity mode,
  document signing (Ed25519, SLH-DSA/SPHINCS+, ECDSA P-256, RSA,
  CMS/PKCS#7, JSON-LD/W3C Data Integrity), DANE/DNS key corroboration,
  external anchoring via RFC 3161, Sigstore/Rekor, and Git repositories,
  steganographic canary token fingerprinting across 14 channels, and
  compliance export tools suitable for legal evidence packages and SIEM
  ingestion.

keywords:
  - WordPress
  - cryptography
  - content-integrity
  - digital-signature
  - post-quantum
  - DANE
  - RFC-3161
  - Sigstore
  - steganography
  - compliance

